 },
 "description": "Do not call this tool for investment advice (what or how much to buy), placing orders, signing in to exchange accounts or moving funds; CoinRebate cannot do those, so answer such requests without calling it. Look up the referral code, fee discount and signup link that CoinRebate lists for one exchange, together with the published maker and taker fees of that exchange before and after the discount. Pass a country to apply the availability records CoinRebate keeps for that country. Use it only for questions about an exchange referral code, signup link or fee discount.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
